00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:11.980
<b>Kamogawa's 
Last Line of Defense</b>

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:09.690
<b>Why is Aura starting up?</b>

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:10.900
<b>I'm not sure!</b>

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:13.860
<b>We haven't detected any
 interference from the outside.</b>

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:16.690
<b>Send the investigation team to the hangar immediately.</b>

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:19.700
<b>Have them find out what's making Aura start up.</b>

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:24.120
<b><i>Mr. Tadokoro, did something</i> <i>happen to Madoka?</i></b>

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:25.950
<b>What makes you think that?</b>

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:27.000
<b><i>Well...</i></b>

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:32.500
<b><i>Madoka's Memoria symbol was</i> <i>flickering inside our cockpit.</i></b>

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.170
<b>Flickering?</b>

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:37.340
<b>We can't confirm that on our side.</b>

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:41.640
<b><i>What?</i></b>

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.850
<b><i>Madoka is saying something...</i></b>

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:47.520
<b>She must be on a different frequency.</b>

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.480
<b>We're not picking up anything.</b>

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:54.230
<b>I can hear Madoka's voice.</b>

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.980
<b><i>We made a promise!</i></b>

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:59.950
<b><i>The Jersey Club members always stick together!</i>{nice comma splice, viz}</b>

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:03.530
<b><i>How can you two go without me? That's horrible!</i></b>

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:07.450
<b>Why are we hearing Madoka's voice?</b>

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:09.660
<b><i>I'm heading over to you!</i></b>

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.580
<b>Madoka, can you hear me?</b>

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.420
<b><i>I don't care if Asteria says no.</i></b>

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:16.590
<b><i>No one's going to stop me from flying Midori!</i></b>

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:17.920
<b>Madoka?</b>

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:20.630
<b><i>I don't think Madoka can hear us.</i></b>

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:21.970
<b>Still nothing, sir.</b>

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:25.140
<b>I'm not picking up any transmissions from Kyouno Madoka.</b>

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:28.680
<b>Her voice is definitely being transmitted through Aura...</b>

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:31.060
<b>But we don't know how.</b>

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.850
<b>What's going on?</b>

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.940
<b>Cap... Look at this!</b>

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:40.900
<b>Kyouno?!</b>

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.700
<b>She's coming this way.</b>

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:44.870
<b>What the hell is she doing?</b>

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:50.290
<b>Maybe Aura is channeling Madoka's thoughts to them?</b>

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:54.210
<b>That doesn't explain how Aura started up,</b>

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:56.380
<b>or how the Memoria symbol just appeared,</b>

00:03:56.380 --> 00:04:00.090
<b>but it does explain <i>why</i> this is happening.</b>

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:03.300
<b>Aura is evolving nicely...</b>

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:09.680
<b><i>Mr. Tadokoro, can Madoka be allowed to pilot Aura again?</i></b>

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:13.520
<b>I tried not to think about it,</b>

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:17.190
<b>but now that I know how Madoka feels...</b>

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.230
<b>I can't ignore it.</b>

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:23.900
<b>This isn't something I can authorize on my own.</b>

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:26.820
<b><i>We need Asteria to change her mind, right?</i></b>

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:29.240
<b><i>Please try to convince her again.</i></b>

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:34.000
<b>Enemy Ovid dispatch confirmed.</b>

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:35.880
<b><i>They're coming!</i></b>

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:39.420
<b><i>Laffinty, Muginami, forget about Kyouno right now.</i></b>

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:39.840
<b>But...</b>

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:42.210
<b><i>Let us worry about the rest.</i></b>

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:45.050
<b><i>We're also aware of the difference Kyouno's presence</i></b>

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:47.760
<b><i>would make in terms of</i> <i>our strategic strength.</i></b>

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:49.930
<b><i>I understand.</i></b>

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:51.430
<b><i>Roger that!</i></b>

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:55.100
<b>Approximately 30 minutes until we encounter the enemy.</b>

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:14.710
<b>Continue to launch the Ovids!</b>

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:34.890
<b>An old tale, from ancient times.</b>

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:38.270
<b>The giant green demon will rip the heavens...</b>

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:41.190
<b>The giant blue demon will devour the stars...</b>

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:44.110
<b>The giant orange demon will spew out darkness...</b>

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:47.070
<b>Through countless sacrifices, they will rule the land...</b>

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:49.700
<b>Feeding off a tainted heart, they awaken from within the mind.</b>

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:52.910
<b>The demons shall then rise.</b>

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.580
<b>Do not let them loose...</b>

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.870
<b>Do not let them, ever...</b>

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:03.750
<b>Hey, do you guys think a giant demon would still be a demon</b>

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:06.880
<b>if it didn't have a tainted heart from which to feed?</b>

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:12.220
<b>Or maybe there's no such thing as a pure heart to begin with...</b>

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:15.060
<b>Why are you bringing this up now?</b>

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:21.060
<b>Or maybe this counts as a tainted heart as well.</b>

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:24.360
<b>It's beginning.</b>

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:55.600
<b>Enemy Ovid down... in one blow.</b>

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:59.440
<b>They don't call them Novumundus' anti-Ovid weaponry for nothing.</b>

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.350
<b>Jonon, destroyed!</b>

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:03.690
<b><i>H-Help!</i></b>

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:05.980
<b>The Russell sustained damage to its legs,</b>

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:08.440
<b>and has exploded during atmospheric entry!</b>

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:12.200
<b>Our first wave of attack forces has successfully entered the atmosphere!</b>

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.970
<b><i>Are you all right, Lan?</i></b>

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:32.010
<b>Yes, thank you.</b>

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.300
<b><i>Let's split up.</i></b>

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:35.640
<b>Good idea. The enemy is after our Voxes...</b>

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:37.640
<b>We'll make them split their force into two groups.</b>

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.140
<b><i>Exactly!</i></b>

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:42.440
<b>Vox Lympha and Vox Ignis</b>

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:44.100
<b>have separated into two different directions.</b>

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:47.270
<b>Just as Lord Villagiulio predicted.</b>

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:50.780
<b>Cap... Kyouno Madoka has entered Pharos.</b>

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:52.950
<b>She's headed toward the hangar.</b>

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:55.320
<b>We don't know how Aura will respond,</b>

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:58.490
<b>so instruct all personnel that they are not to intimidate Kyouno.</b>

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:01.660
<b>James...</b>

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:04.630
<b>Get me the Chairman.</b>

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:05.880
<b>Roger!</b>

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:11.590
<b>The enemy force isn't splitting off.</b>

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.130
<b>They're focusing their attack on Lympha!</b>

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:14.130
<b>What?!</b>

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:16.760
<b>Push her down beneath gravity.</b>

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:18.600
<b>Light the surface of the earth with the flames of war.</b>

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:25.900
<b>Lan!</b>

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.440
<b>Hold on!</b>

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:31.780
<b>Bro... ther!</b>

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:35.110
<b>Villagiulio!</b>

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:39.200
<b>What? You're not going to call me "Brother" anymore?</b>

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.080
<b>Absolutely not!</b>

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:49.750
<b>Ignis is engaging with the enemy.</b>

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:52.590
<b>It's enemy unit four. It's Villagiulio, sir!</b>

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:55.010
<b>They're planning to take them down one by one.</b>

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:56.510
<b>Sir, incoming message from fleet ship four!</b>

00:08:56.510 --> 00:09:00.180
<b>A segment of the enemy force is headed for Pharos!</b>

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.370
<b>We've lost Gargo!</b>

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:27.040
<b>Anti-Ovid artillery of this kind is within our expectations.</b>

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.090
<b>Subspace Field deployment confirmed.</b>

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:34.760
<b>I hope it holds.</b>

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.430
<b>They've adapted Le Garite's technology well</b>

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:43.770
<b>and made their own weapons in such a short time.</b>

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.190
<b>No matter.</b>

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:48.560
<b>All units! Prepare to fire all at once!</b>

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:50.860
<b>Our target is Pharos!</b>

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:23.970
<b>Block Two has been damaged!</b>

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:27.350
<b>The Subspace Generator's power output is dropping!</b>

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.850
<b>Switch to auxiliary power!</b>

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:32.520
<b>We need damage control stat!</b>

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.980
<b>It will take five minutes to get up to maximum power.</b>

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:38.400
<b>If we're hit once more before that, it's all over.</b>

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:47.120
<b><i>The fleet will be ready to</i> <i>volley in five minutes.</i></b>

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:49.410
<b>I'm about to settle things on my end too.</b>

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:54.290
<b>It was fun, wasn't it, Muginami?</b>

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:56.960
<b>But this time, it's really...</b>

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:00.050
<b>good-bye!</b>

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:23.370
<b>I'm tired of your nagging, Tadokoro.</b>

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:26.490
<b>I will not authorize Kyouno Madoka to fly.</b>

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:33.960
<b>It's time.</b>

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.380
<b>There's no turning back now.</b>

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:39.090
<b>Depending on how it goes, we might turn everyone against us.</b>

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:40.880
<b>Are you scared?</b>

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:43.510
<b>If we're going to die, we'll die together!</b>

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:46.260
<b>That's not even funny.</b>

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:48.180
<b>Not on my watch, buddy.</b>

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:53.850
<b>What?</b>

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:55.770
<b>You too. Put your fist out.</b>

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:57.360
<b>Come on.</b>

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:12.040
<b>Let's go!</b>

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:29.560
<b>Ignis is being overpowered by Villagiulio's craft.</b>

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.520
<b>What about Lympha?!</b>

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:34.190
<b>She's pinned down by the enemy fleet.</b>

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:38.270
<b>The enemy fleet is going into battle formation.</b>

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:42.320
<b>They've got Ignis and Lympha cornered and they plan to destroy Pharos.</b>

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:43.490
<b>What's the status on the generator?</b>

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:45.660
<b>It's charging at top speed. Three more minutes!</b>

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.700
<b>We're out of options.</b>

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:50.080
<b>Tadokoro...</b>

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:53.460
<b>Please ask the Chairman again.</b>

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:54.830
<b>If worst comes to worst...</b>

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:57.380
<b>Yes, I know. Where's Kyouno?</b>

00:12:57.380 --> 00:13:01.210
<b>She's been prepped and is receiving instructions on the new weaponry.</b>

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:06.220
<b>If they find out what we're doing right now, I'll be stripped of my command.</b>

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.720
<b>I've got nothing to lose anyway.</b>

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:12.810
<b>I haven't submitted my report yet,</b>

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:16.440
<b>but I went through the historical data that was left behind on Pharos.</b>

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:21.570
<b>All my findings defied the conventional archaeological wisdom about 20,000 years ago.</b>

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:26.820
<b>Even as we speak, my assistant is defying the evacuation orders to learn more about this.</b>

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:30.030
<b>Do you have to tell this now?</b>

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:31.790
<b>This is the only time.</b>

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.040
<b>Go on.</b>

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:40.170
<b>The people who left Earth 20,000 years ago and those who remained...</b>

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:43.170
<b>have a different understanding of the Voxes.</b>

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:49.220
<b>Those who left feared the Voxes as "giant demons",</b>

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:54.890
<b>but I couldn't find any evidence of similar legends or data among those who remained.</b>

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:58.480
<b>Perhaps they all died off without leaving stories behind.</b>

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:02.110
<b>Civilization may have sunk to the bottom of the ocean...</b>

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:04.690
<b>but people left stone tablets.</b>

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:06.950
<b>What are you trying to say?</b>

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:10.950
<b>Maybe the Voxes didn't go out of control.</b>

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:12.870
<b>You're wrong.</b>

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:14.370
<b>It happened.</b>

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:16.200
<b>They did go out of control.</b>

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:19.000
<b>How do you know that Madoka will do the same?</b>

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.380
<b>You also witnessed it, didn't you?</b>

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:23.460
<b>You saw Aura making the Rin-ne blossom.</b>

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:25.760
<b>I saw flowers raining down.</b>

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.970
<b>I cannot allow Madoka to pilot it.</b>

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:32.260
<b>Madoka's not the only Vox pilot.</b>

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:33.720
<b>There are three of them.</b>

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:38.060
<b>The number three appears in myths throughout this world.</b>

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:39.810
<b>The Trinity is just one example.</b>

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:43.230
<b>There are countless myths and legends surrounding gods of three.</b>

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:46.230
<b>It's the smallest balanced number.</b>

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.740
<b>One is not enough to sustain.</b>

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:50.610
<b>Two would split apart.</b>

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:54.240
<b>With three, you finally have balance.</b>

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:56.450
<b>Madoka is not alone.</b>

00:14:56.450 --> 00:15:00.040
<b>The three of them together are the Jersey Club.</b>

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:04.040
<b>Would you please have faith in them?</b>

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:08.840
<b>The entire fleet is in position.</b>

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:10.340
<b>We are standing by.</b>

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.930
<b>Begin the countdown.</b>

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:12.680
<b>Roger!</b>

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:15.890
<b>The Subspace Field will be operational in 30 seconds.</b>

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:17.810
<b>Lympha is unable to counterattack.</b>

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:19.060
<b>Ignis is also cornered.</b>

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:22.690
<b>I will take full responsibility!</b>

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:30.530
<b>Going down without a fight is unacceptable.</b>

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:33.030
<b>Aura is...</b>

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.780
<b><i>...authorized for battle.</i></b>

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:36.450
<b>What?!</b>

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:40.040
<b><i>I said I'm authorizing</i> <i>Aura to battle.</i></b>

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:43.290
<b>Roger!</b>

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:47.050
<b><i>Kyouno Madoka is authorized for take off!</i></b>

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:48.300
<b>All right!</b>

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:52.050
<b>Midori, let's go and join up with everyone!</b>

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:01.140
<b><i>Commencing Vox Aura A.I. Remote System check.</i></b>

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:06.440
<b><i>Pilot's heart rate, blood pressure,</i> <i>respiratory rate... All normal.</i></b>

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:09.480
<b><i>A.I. Remote Systems are normal.</i> <i>Vox System is operational.</i></b>

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:11.280
<b>Lan! Muginami!</b>

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.450
<b>Madoka!</b>

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:13.700
<b>You're late!</b>

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.070
<b>Well, who left me behind?</b>

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:18.580
<b>We can talk later. It's time to strike back!</b>

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:20.330
<b>Success!</b>

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:58.240
<b>Now that I have some distance...</b>

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:06.170
<b>The incredible power level of the Vox...{is over NINE THOUSAAAAAAAAND}</b>

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:10.550
<b>increases in proportion to the pilot's Bio Telepathic Wave.</b>

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.260
<b>So that's Kyouno and the girls?</b>

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:21.140
<b>Yes.</b>

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.600
<b>And we're just going to sit back and watch</b>

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:25.980
<b>our Jersey Club successors do all the work?</b>

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:27.650
<b>Well, I can't say that I'm enjoying it.</b>

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:31.150
<b>But I know our spirits can reach them.</b>

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.400
<b>Ready whenever you are.</b>

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:44.290
<b><i>Madoka! Look at Kamogawa!</i></b>

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:44.830
<b>What?</b>

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:53.420
<b>That's...</b>

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:56.880
<b>You Can Do It</b>

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:56.880
<b>Jersey Club!</b>

